WEBVTT

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:48.460
<i>Mommy is busy!</i>

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:02.180
That's right.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:05.100
If you want to protect your family...

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:08.850
you know what to do.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:01.700
<i>Where's Theo?</i>

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:04.610
<i>Theo is right in front of me!</i>

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:06.370
<i>But he's being targeted by someone!</i>

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:07.950
<i>Targeted?</i>

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:11.040
<i>-Damn it!</i>
<i>-Who are they?</i>

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.750
<i>Theo put on some weird Mask</i>

00:04:14.170 --> 00:04:15.290
<i>and dodged a bullet!</i>

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:16.590
<i>Who are they?</i>

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:17.750
<i>Did you say Mask?</i>

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:19.460
<i>So, he did have one!</i>

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:21.590
<i>Mask?</i>

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:29.100
<i>It's Grimm all over again!</i>

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:32.600
<i>-Eddy! Eddy!</i>
-They know about Grimm's Mask.

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:34.310
<i>We have to take Theo into the SSC!</i>

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:35.400
<i>Got it?</i>

00:04:40.650 --> 00:04:41.570
<i>SSC?</i>

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:43.530
<i>They're police?</i>

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:51.160
Police?

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:57.540
<i>Police, huh?</i>

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:00.300
Stand ready.

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:06.800
You no longer...

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:09.260
have...

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:11.010
any choice.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:34.830
<i>Eddy!</i>

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:46.420
Please move.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:49.390
<i>What happened?</i>

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:51.970
<i>Theo just started running!</i>

00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:54.310
I'm going after him now.

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:57.730
Eddy, don't lose him.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:04.900
Send me his location.

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:08.570
I'm going after him.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:11.990
<i>Don't lose him?</i>

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:14.200
<i>Do you think it's that easy?</i>

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:24.960
Not all of us...

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.010
hit the gym every day!

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:32.350
Follow me.

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:35.270
<i>There's something...</i>

00:06:35.680 --> 00:06:37.180
I want you to do for me.

00:06:55.330 --> 00:06:56.580
Goddamn it!

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:04.250
So, he took off the Mask.

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:19.890
Damn it.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:33.490
Theo, what were you trying to...?

00:07:57.970 --> 00:07:58.810
Theo!

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:00.430
Theo Lowe!

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:01.850
No.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:03.440
You got it wrong!

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:05.440
I'm not with them!

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:08.820
I'm not the one trying to kill you!

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:13.110
You're supposed to be dead.
How are you here?

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:15.820
Me? Dead?

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:18.830
That's right! And not just you.

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:22.330
I need you to listen to me.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:27.500
Last night, a man named Grimm
attacked the police.

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:30.340
He attacked the police?

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:33.550
And that Grimm was supposed to have died.

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:35.720
But he was alive!

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:37.300
And now you, too.

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:39.310
It's unbelievable.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:43.770
I'm with the police.

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.150
My ID is in my pocket.

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:58.070
I want you to look at the tablet, too.

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:14.090
When I was looking into Grimm...

00:09:15.380 --> 00:09:17.470
I found out about you and the others.

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:20.010
So, this is how you found me.

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:23.890
Why are you and Grimm alive?

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:29.230
That's not all.

00:09:30.020 --> 00:09:32.730
There's a lot more I want to ask you!

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:36.150
Hey!

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:39.160
We want to know the truth!

00:09:47.210 --> 00:09:48.670
You want me to help you?

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:58.680
Someone was trying to kill you.

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:02.680
Will you let me take you in
as a material witness?

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:08.690
I'll protect you! You have to believe me!

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:12.690
But, in exchange...

00:10:13.610 --> 00:10:14.690
What is it?

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:28.080
There's one thing I want you to do for me.

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:31.460
No problem, what is it?

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:44.510
Theo?

00:10:45.850 --> 00:10:47.680
Hey, Theo! Theo!

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:49.020
Theo!

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:56.360
There's no sign of dysfunction
or transplant rejection.

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:04.240
The transplanted heart
is working properly.

00:11:04.950 --> 00:11:07.040
There's no worry of infection either.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:09.830
Thank goodness.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:12.540
You're a healthy little girl!

00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:17.760
Mommy, Mommy.

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:21.630
May...

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.220
I'm so relieved.

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:30.480
Theo...

00:11:34.190 --> 00:11:35.020
You have Theo?

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:36.520
Yeah.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:39.490
He's just unconscious right now.

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:43.280
I'm already heading back to the station.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:45.410
<i>Let's meet there.</i>

00:11:55.420 --> 00:11:56.670
Don't worry,

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:58.800
I was able to get through to him.

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:00.210
<i>We're okay.</i>

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:04.550
I don't think he's going to do anything.

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:12.640
<i>James?</i>

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:15.900
Eddy.

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:19.690
Be careful.

00:12:21.490 --> 00:12:22.820
He's being targeted.

00:12:25.240 --> 00:12:26.320
<i>Don't forget that.</i>

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:30.120
<i>They're still coming after Theo.</i>

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:35.920
<i>Listen, Eddy.</i>

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:39.920
Head to the station,
and only use the major roads.

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:42.920
<i>That should make you a harder target.</i>

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:44.470
Got it?

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:51.560
Theo's in your hands.

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:57.480
<i>I'm heading back now, too.</i>
<i>We can talk more there.</i>

00:14:08.590 --> 00:14:10.720
-I don't regret any of it.
-Theo!

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:17.190
That was the only thing I could do
to save my daughter.

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:21.860
So, Theo, I'm...

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:24.150
I know.

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:26.490
You're taking me to the SSC, right?

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:30.700
Are you feeling okay?

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:33.910
Yeah.

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:39.580
And what was it
you wanted us to do for you?

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:54.140
-May!
-May!

00:14:57.390 --> 00:14:58.640
I'm home!

00:15:02.610 --> 00:15:04.480
She said there's nothing to worry about.

00:15:05.270 --> 00:15:06.690
Oh, that's great.

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:10.820
-I'm home!
-That's wonderful news, May!

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.830
You two will have many years to come.

00:15:22.790 --> 00:15:23.630
I know...

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:26.960
Theo is smiling down on us.

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:03.290
I...

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:09.590
I want to see my family.

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:18.180
But they--

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:22.480
They were already close by.

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:31.820
I can't get near them...

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:38.910
or protect them.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:49.050
We'll protect your family.

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:55.970
I promise.

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:01.930
I promise you will get to see them again.

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:06.480
That's your condition, isn't it?

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:15.910
Yes. Please.

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:31.000
The research facility...

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:34.040
was on the outskirts.

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:37.710
Both Grimm and I were there.

00:19:43.010 --> 00:19:45.390
This is probably an experiment.

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:47.180
Is that...?

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:53.900
What is it?

00:19:54.730 --> 00:19:55.770
Good question.

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:00.900
I don't even know.

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:05.830
When I put this on,

00:20:06.240 --> 00:20:08.830
everything around me seems like it stops.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.920
So, the reason you were able
to dodge bullets...

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:16.670
Is thanks to this.

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:21.420
I wasn't the only one with a Mask.

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:23.550
Grimm had one, too.

00:20:25.010 --> 00:20:25.850
Grimm...

00:20:26.430 --> 00:20:27.430
I knew it.

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:30.020
That explains his...

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:34.690
There were others who escaped from there.

00:20:35.860 --> 00:20:38.480
And they all had Masks.

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:43.280
They all must be targets, too.

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:47.950
You're all people who should be dead.

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:50.450
Most likely.

00:20:52.040 --> 00:20:53.620
Who is targeting you?

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:58.710
I don't know the details.

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:06.010
But they weren't good people.

00:21:10.220 --> 00:21:11.470
It definitely...

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:14.440
has something to do with that.

00:21:40.590 --> 00:21:41.420
Who...

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:44.800
could it be?

00:24:19.330 --> 00:24:21.830
Subtitle translation by Zensho Yamamoto
